  "summary": "Malicious code in @servicetitan/json-render-react (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases and executes a 727KB Bun-compiled file (math_init.js) during npm install. The Bun-compiled payload is opaque. This version carries an injected preinstall hook that downloads and executes an opaque binary payload at install time.",
